# VesperOS's own packages (PKGBUILDs in the vesperos repository), in build
# order. Built only when the sources can be fetched: the repositories are
# private, so the build needs VESPER_SOURCES_TOKEN (a read-only token).
vesper-compo
vesper-menus
vesper-settings
vesper-player
vesper-filebrowser
vesper-web-browser
vesper-keyboard
vesper-store
vesperos-splash
# River (river-tv): built from the public River repository.
river-tv
# dopeIPTV: built from the public fork with TV mode (its tv-mode branch).
dopeiptv
vesper-session
